Z||000000||BAM-BAM||03-20-2000||11:16 PM||||   Iwas thinking, again, and this time I might have something. Two things came to mind; 1.) I was thinking about puting a rear spoiler on my 85GT, but the stock production model doesn't really appeal to me. So, I turned around to walk in the house and I was caught by the nice shapely low profile design<BR>of the rear deck spoiler on my 95 Grand Prix.<BR>What do you all think? Would that look allright? I think it would add some lines and keep it mild. 2.) I have to replace the right side power mirror and the remote console switch. So, there I was,cruising around on E-BAY looking for some mirrors when I happened on a set out of a ninety GTA,<BR>complete with the console switch which looked strangely familiar. Has anyone ever tried or heard of this kind of upgrade or replacement? Well, those were my thoughts <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">. I must rest now. Let me know; thumbs up or thumbs ddown. Hey at least it's all in the (Pontiac) Family <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> Thans BAM-BAM <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||5
